   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flood Control Using Integrated Dam Management System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance flood resilience in Kazakhstan by strengthening dam safety and flood preparedness, directly supporting the disaster risk reduction and water priority sectors outlined in Kazakhstans updated Nationally Determined Contributions (NDC). The updated NDC includes a dedicated chapter on climate change adaptation, emphasizing the importance of water resources management and disaster risk reduction as national adaptation priorities. This project aligns with these goals by imp</narrative>
  </description>
